<Base title="CV" description="CV of Nihal Vellaramkallingal Sulaiman: data analyst and BI developer in Ontario. SQL, Python, star schemas, dashboards, forecasting and machine learning.">
<main class="prof">
  <h1 class="name"><b>Nihal</b> Vellaramkallingal Sulaiman</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Data analyst and BI developer · Niagara Falls, Ontario · open to roles anywhere in Ontario</p>
  <ProfileLinks print />

  <h2>summary</h2>
  <p>Data analyst with a Master's in Data Analytics and an MSc in Physics. I build end-to-end data work in Python and SQL: ETL pipelines, star-schema warehouses with automated quality checks, KPI dashboards, demand forecasts and optimised schedules. Comfortable with the mathematics behind a model and with explaining the result in plain language.</p>

  <h2>skills</h2>
  <dl class="skills">
    <dt>Data and SQL</dt><dd>SQL (SQL Server, SQLite), dimensional modelling, ETL, data-quality checks, Python (pandas, NumPy, Polars)</dd>
    <dt>BI and reporting</dt><dd>KPI design, dashboards (Chart.js, D3), Excel, Power BI (learning), hotel revenue metrics: occupancy, ADR, RevPAR, pace</dd>
    <dt>Modelling</dt><dd>Forecasting, integer programming (PuLP), machine learning (XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost, Optuna), deep learning and reinforcement learning (PyTorch)</dd>
    <dt>Engineering</dt><dd>Git and GitHub, pytest, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Claude Code with read-only safety rules, LaTeX</dd>
  </dl>

