    <p class="where">DataCurve (Shipd), United States</p>
    <p>Invited after my result in Kaggle's Mallorn Challenge. Train and evaluate AI models on technical tasks.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="item">
    <div class="head"><h3>Room Attendant, hotel housekeeping</h3><span class="when">Over one year</span></div>
    <p class="where">Niagara Falls, Ontario</p>
    <p>Also trained as night attendant and houseman. A floor-level view of room turns, staffing and demand swings, which shaped my hospitality BI work.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="item">
    <div class="head"><h3>Owner, ad-supported content websites</h3><span class="when">2019 – 2022</span></div>
