  <div class="item">
    <div class="head"><h3><a href="/kaggle/">Kaggle</a></h3><span class="when">2026</span></div>
    <p>Name That LLM: top 10% of 4,346 (public leaderboard, in progress). Squares in Squares: top 13% of 1,473 (in progress).</p>
